#: ../../../changelog.md:702
msgid "Fixed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:650
msgid ""
"Using ``trace on`` with ``.xsh`` scripts could previously lead to a spurious "
"ignored exception showing up on stderr. This is now fixed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:652
msgid ""
"pipelines: fixed ``'NoneType' object has no attribute 'pid'`` exception "
"(#5794)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:654
msgid "Security"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:656
msgid ""
"The ``history delete`` action on the sqlite backend used to pass matched "
"history lines to a SQL statement without sanitization. This could lead to "
"unexpected SQL being run on the history database. This is now fixed. "
"Security risk: low."
msgstr ""

