#: ../../../changelog.md:673
msgid ""
"**env:** Add `$XONSH_PROMPT_CURSOR_SHAPE` for configuring prompt cursor "
"shape."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:674
msgid ""
"**env:** Added `XONSH_CONFIG_DIR`, `XONSH_DATA_DIR`, and `XONSH_CACHE_DIR`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:675
msgid ""
"**SIGHUP** will now be forwarded to child processes when received by the "
"main xonsh process. This matches the behavior of other shells, e.g., bash."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:677
msgid ""
"Documented the fact that the `on_postcommand` event only fires in "
"interactive mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:678
msgid ""
"**history:** Added and documented `--session-id` parameter for `history "
"pull` command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:679
msgid "**history-json:** Implemented `history pull` for JSON history backend."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:683
msgid ""
"Running a subcommand in an event handler will no longer block xonsh from "
"exiting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:684
msgid ""
"**history:** Prevented `history pull` command from adding consecutive "
"duplicates to prompter history."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:685
msgid ""
"**prompt toolkit:** Fixed autosuggest sometimes not updating when up-arrow "
"is pressed (#5787)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:686
msgid ""
"**Subprocess-based completions** like [`xontrib-fish-completer`](https://"
"github.com/xonsh/xontrib-fish-completer) no longer append a space if the "
"single available completion ends with a directory separator. This is "
"consistent with the behavior of the default completer."
msgstr ""

