msgid ""
"The environment variables `XONSHRC` and `XONSHRC_DIR` are no longer updated "
"by xonsh on startup according to which files were actually loaded. This "
"caused problems if xonsh is called recursively, as the child shells would "
"inherit the modified startup environment of the parent. These variables will "
"now be left untouched, and the actual RC files loaded (according to those "
"variables and command line arguments) can be seen in the output of `xonfig`."
