msgid ""
"New `xonsh.events.EventManager.exists()` method enables checking whether "
"events actually exist without making the event if it doesn\\'t exist."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:3756
msgid ""
"New command-specific event categories called `on_pre_spec_run_<cmd-name>` "
"and `on_post_spec_run_<cmd-name>` will be fired before and after `SubpocSpec."
"run()` is called. This allows for command specific events to be executed. "
"For example, `on_pre_spec_run_ls` would be run prior to an invocation of "
"`ls`."
msgstr ""

