msgid ""
"New `xonsh.environ.LsColors` class for managing the `$LS_COLORS` environment "
"variable. This ensures that the `ls` command respects the "
"`$XONSH_COLOR_STYLE` setting. An instance of this class is added to the "
"environment when either the `$LS_COLORS` class is first accessed or the `ls` "
"command is executed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:3766
msgid ""
"The `on_pre_spec_run_ls` event is initialized with a default handler that "
"ensures that `$LS_COLORS` is set in the actual environment prior to running "
"an `ls` command."
msgstr ""

