msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:3779
msgid ""
"An environment variable `detype` operation no longer needs to be a function, "
"but may also be `None`. If `None`, this variable is considered not "
"detypeable, and will not be exported to subprocess environments via the `Env."
"detype()` function."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:3783
msgid ""
"An environment variable `detype` function no longer needs to return a "
"string, but may also return `None`. If `None` is returned, this variable is "
"considered not detypeable, and will not be exported to subprocess "
"environments via the `Env.detype()` function."
msgstr ""

