"Xonsh\\'s script and code caches will are now invalidated whenever the xonsh "
"version changes for a given Python version."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5128
msgid ""
"Autowrapping of subprocess globs has been improved to cover more cases that "
"are ambiguous with Python syntax."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5130
msgid ""
"Job control info when foregrounding or backgrounding jobs will now only be "
"displayed when xonsh is in interactive mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5132
msgid ""
"Enabled virtual terminal processing in the prompt-toolkit shell for Windows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5137
msgid ""
"3rd party pygments styles (like solorized or monokailight) are now able to "
"be used in xonsh. These styles are dynamically created upon first use, "
"rather than being lazily loaded by xonsh."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5140
msgid ""
"On Windows, `os.environ` is case insensitive. This would potentially change "
"the case of environment variables set into the environment. Xonsh now uses "
"`nt.environ`, the case sensitive counterpart, to avoid these issues on "
"Windows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5144
msgid "Fix how `$PWD` is managed in order to work with symlinks gracefully"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5145
msgid ""
"`history replay` no longer barfs on `style_name` when setting up the "
"environment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5147
msgid ""
"`Shell.shell_type` is now properly set to the same value as `$SHELL_TYPE`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5149
msgid "Fixed `source-zsh` to work with zsh v5.2."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5150
msgid "Fixed issue where `del (x, y)` would raise a syntax error."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5151
msgid ""
"Certain vim commands issue commands involving subshells, and this is now "
"supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5153
msgid ""
"Null bytes handed to Popen are now automatically escaped prior to running a "
"subprocess. This prevents Popen from issuing embedded null byte exceptions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5156
msgid ""
"Xonsh will no longer crash is the current working directory is removed out "
"from under it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5158
msgid "Multiline strings can now be written in subprocess mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5159
msgid ""
"PTK completions will now correctly deduplicate autosuggest completions and "
"display completions values based on the cursor position."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5162
msgid ""
"Fixed bug where trailing backspaces on Windows paths could be interpreted as "
"line continuations characters. Now line continuation characters must be "
"preceded by a space on Windows. This only applies to xonsh in interactive "
"mode to ensure scripts are portable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5166
msgid ""
"Importing `*.xsh` files will now respect the encoding listed in that file "
"and properly fallback to UTF-8. This behaviour follows the rules described "
"in PEP 263."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5169
msgid "Wizard is now able to properly serialize environment paths."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5171
msgid "v0.5.6"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5175
msgid ""
"New core utility function aliases (written in pure Python) are now available "
"in `xonsh.xoreutils`. These include: `cat`, `echo`, `pwd`, `tee`, `tty`, and "
"`yes`. These are not enabled by default. Use the new `coreutils` xontrib to "
"load them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5179
msgid "CircleCI test post codecov run"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5180
msgid ""
"The `trace` will automatically disable color printing when stdout is not a "
"TTY or stdout is captured."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5182
msgid ""
"New `jedi` xontrib enables jedi-based tab completions when it is loaded. "
"This supersedes xonsh\\'s default Python-mode completer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5184
msgid ""
"The lexer has a new `split()` method which splits strings according to "
"xonsh\\'s rules for whitespace and quotes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5186
msgid ""
"New events for hooking into the Python import process are now available. You "
"can now provide a handler for:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5188
msgid "`on_import_pre_find_spec`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5189
msgid "`on_import_post_find_spec`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5190
msgid "`on_import_pre_create_module`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5191
msgid "`on_import_post_create_module`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5192
msgid "`on_import_pre_exec_module`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5193
msgid "`on_import_post_exec_module`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5197
msgid ""
"The prompt toolkit shell\\'s first completion will now be the current token "
"from the auto-suggestion, if available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5199
msgid ""
"Sourcing foreign shells will now safely skip applying aliases with the same "
"name as existing xonsh aliases by default. This prevents accidentally "
"overwriting important xonsh standard aliases, such as `cd`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5206
msgid ""
"Threadable prediction for subprocesses will now consult both the command as "
"it was typed in and any resolved aliases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5208
msgid ""
"The first prompt will no longer print in the middle of the line if the user "
"has already started typing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5210
msgid ""
"Windows consoles will now automatically enable virtual terminal processing "
"with the readline shell, if available. This allows the full use of ANSI "
"escape sequences."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5213
msgid ""
"On the Windows readline shell, the tab-completion suppression prompt will no "
"longer error out depending on what you press."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5215
msgid ""
"Fixed issue with subprocess mode wrapping not respecting line continuation "
"backslashes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5217
msgid ""
"Handle a bug where Bash On Windows causes platform.windows_bash_command() to "
"raise CalledProcessError."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5219
msgid ""
"Fixed issues pertaining to completing from raw string paths. This is "
"particularly relevant to Windows, where raw strings are inserted in path "
"completion."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5222
msgid ""
"Replace deprecated calls to `time.clock()` by calls to `time.perf_counter()`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5224
msgid ""
"Use `clock()` to set the start time of `_timings` in non-windows instead of "
"manually setting it to `0.0`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5226
msgid ""
"The `trace` utility will now correctly color output and not print extraneous "
"newlines when called in a script."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5228
msgid ""
"The `@$(cmd)` operator now correctly splits strings according to xonsh "
"semantics, rather than just on whitespace using `str.split()`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5230
msgid ""
"The `mpl` xontrib has been updated to improve matplotlib handling. If "
"`xontrib load mpl` is run before matplotlib is imported and xonsh is in "
"interactive mode, matplotlib will automatically enter interactive mode as "
"well. Additionally, `pyplot.show()` is patched in interactive mode to be non-"
"blocking. If a non-blocking show fails to draw the figure for some reason, a "
"regular blocking version is called."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5237
msgid ""
"Fixed issues like `timeit ls` causing OSError - \\\"Inappropriate ioctl for "
"device\\\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5239
msgid ""
"Fixed a potential \\\"OSError: \\[Errno 22\\] Invalid argument\\\" to "
"increase job control stability."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5242
msgid "v0.5.5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5246
msgid ""
"New `--rc` command line option allows users to specify paths to run control "
"files from the command line. This includes both xonsh-based and JSON-based "
"configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5249
msgid ""
"New `$UPDATE_COMPLETIONS_ON_KEYPRESS` controls whether or not completions "
"will automatically display and update while typing. This feature is only "
"available in the prompt-toolkit shell."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5255
msgid ""
"Xonsh scripts now report `__file__` and `__name__` when run as scripts or "
"sourced. These variables have the same meaning as they do in Python scripts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5258
msgid ""
"`$XONSHRC` and related configuration variables now accept JSON-based static "
"configuration file names as elements. This unifies the two methods of run "
"control to a single entry point and loading system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5261
msgid ""
"The `xonsh.shell.Shell()` class now requires that an Execer instance be "
"explicitly provided to its init method. This class is no longer responsible "
"for creating an execer an its dependencies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5264
msgid ""
"Moved decorators `unthreadable`, `uncapturable` from `xonsh.proc` to `xonsh."
"tools`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5266
msgid "Some refactorings on jobs control."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5270
msgid ""
"The `--config-path` command line option is now deprecated in favor of `--rc`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5275
msgid ""
"`xonsh.environ.DEFAULT_XONSHRC` has been removed due to deprecation. For "
"this value, please check the environment instead, or call `xonsh.environ."
"default_xonshrc(env)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5281
msgid ""
"Command pipelines that end in a callable alias are now interruptable with "
"`^C` and the processes that are piped into the alias have their file handles "
"closed. This should ensure that the entire pipeline is closed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5285
msgid ""
"Fixed issue where unthreadable subprocs were not allowed to be captured with "
"the `$(cmd)` operator."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5287
msgid ""
"The `ProcProxy` class (unthreadable aliases) was not being executed and "
"would hang if the alias was capturable. This has been fixed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5289
msgid ""
"Fixed a `tcsetattr: Interrupted system call` issue when run xonsh scripts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5291
msgid ""
"Fixed issue with `ValueError` being thrown from `inspect.signature()` when "
"called on C-extension callables in tab completer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5294
msgid "Fixed issue that `ls | less` crashes on Mac."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5295
msgid ""
"Threadable prediction was incorrectly based on the user input command, "
"rather than the version where aliases have been resolved. This has been "
"corrected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5299
msgid "v0.5.4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5303
msgid ""
"Add alias `xip` (\\\"kip\\\") so that xonsh\\'s Python environment (whatever "
"that is) can be modified."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5305
msgid ""
"HistoryEntry, a SimpleNamespace object that represents a command in history."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5307
msgid "`xonsh.completers.bash_completion` module"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5308
msgid ""
"Added option to report timing information of xonsh startup times. Start "
"xonsh with the `--timings` flag to use the feature."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5310
msgid ""
"The Python tab completer will now complete the argument names of functions "
"and other callables."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5312
msgid ""
"Uptime module added to `xonsh.xoreutils`. This can report the system boot "
"time and up time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5314
msgid ""
"The environment variable `XONSH_HISTORY_BACKEND` now also supports a value "
"of class type or a History Backend instance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5316
msgid "`on_envvar_new` event that fires after a new envvar is created."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5317
msgid "`on_envvar_change` event that fires after an envvar is changed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5321
msgid "history indexing api to be more simple, now returns HistoryEntry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5322
msgid ""
"Decoupled `bash_completion` from xonsh project and added shim back to xonsh."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5324
msgid ""
"The JSON history backend will now unlock history files that were created "
"prior to the last reboot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5329
msgid ""
"Fixed broken bash completions on Windows if \\'Windows Subsystem for "
"Linux\\' is installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5331
msgid ""
"Readline history would try to read the first element of history prior to "
"actually loading any history. This caused an exception to be raised on "
"Windows at xonsh startup when using pyreadline."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5334
msgid ""
"Fixed issue with readline tab completer overwriting initial prefix in some "
"instances."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5336
msgid ""
"Fixed issue wherein if `git` or (presumably) `hg` are aliased, then branch "
"information no longer appears in the `$PROMPT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5338
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with commands that background themselves (such as `gpg-"
"connect-agent`) not being able to be run from within xonshrc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5341
msgid "v0.5.3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5345
msgid ""
"Tab completion xontrib for python applications based on click framework."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5347
msgid ""
"Added `on_transform_command` event for pre-processing that macros can\\'t "
"handle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5349
msgid "Autodetection of backgroundability by binary analysis on POSIX."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5350
msgid "New argument `expand_user=True` to `tools.expand_path`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5351
msgid ""
"New `$COMPLETION_QUERY_LIMIT` environment variable for setting the number of "
"completions above which the user will be asked if they wish to see the "
"potential completions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5354
msgid "Users may now redirect stdout to stderr in subprocess mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5358
msgid ""
"The `Block` and `Functor` context managers from `xonsh.contexts` have been "
"rewritten to use xonsh\\'s macro capabilities. You must now enter these via "
"the `with!` statement, e.g. `with! Block(): pass`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5361
msgid ""
"The `distributed` xontrib now needs to use the `with!` statement, since it "
"relies on `Functor`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5363
msgid "`telnet` has been flagged as unthreadable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5364
msgid ""
"When `$DYNAMIC_CWD_ELISION_CHAR` is non empty and the last dir of cwd is too "
"long and shortened, the elision char is added at the end."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5366
msgid ""
"`pygments` is no longer a strict dependency of the `prompt_toolkit` backend. "
"If `pygments` is not installed, the PTK backend will use the default ansi "
"color settings from the terminal. Syntax highlighting requires that "
"`pygments` is installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5370
msgid "Events are now keyword arguments only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5371
msgid "Restored `on_precommand` to its original signature."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5372
msgid "Move `built_ins.expand_path` to `tools.expand_path`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5373
msgid "Rename `tools.expandpath` to `tools._expandpath`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5374
msgid "Added `gvim` command to unthreadable predictors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5375
msgid "The `source` alias now passes `$ARGS` down to file it is sourcing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5379
msgid ""
"`XonshBlockError` has been removed, since it no longer serves a purpose."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5384
msgid ""
"`PopenThread` will now re-issue SIGINT to the main thread when it is "
"received."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5386
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that using sqlite history backend does not kill unfinished "
"jobs when quitting xonsh with a second \\\"exit\\\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5388
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that xonsh would fail over to external shells when running ."
"xsh script which raises exceptions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5390
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with `openpty()` returning non-unix line endings in its "
"buffer. This was causing git and ssh to fail when xonsh was used as the "
"login shell on the server. See <https://mail.python.org/pipermail/python-"
"list/2013-June/650460.html> for more details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5395
msgid "Restored the ability to \\^Z and `fg` processes on posix platforms."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5396
msgid ""
"CommandPipelines were not guaranteed to have been ended when the return code "
"was requested. This has been fixed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5398
msgid ""
"Introduce path expansion in `is_writable_file` to fix "
"`$XONSH_TRACEBACK_LOGFILE=~/xonsh.log`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5400
msgid ""
"Backgrounding a running process (\\^Z) now restores ECHO mode to the "
"terminal in cases where the subprocess doesn\\'t properly restore itself. A "
"major instance of this behaviour is Python\\'s interactive interpreter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5404
msgid ""
"Readline backend would not ask the user to confirm the printing of "
"completion options if they numbered above a certain value. Instead they "
"would be dumped to the screen. This has been fixed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5407
msgid ""
"Jupyter kernel was no longer properly running subprocess commands. This has "
"been fixed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5409
msgid ""
"The filename is applied to the target of the `source` alias, providing "
"better tracebacks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5412
msgid "v0.5.2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5416
msgid "Added `weechat` to default predictors"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5417
msgid ""
"`$DYNAMIC_CWD_ELISION_CHAR` environment variable to control how a shortened "
"path is displayed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5422
msgid ""
"`_ret_code` function of `prompt_ret_code` xontrib return now `None` when "
"return code is 0 instead of empty string allowing more customization of "
"prompt format."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5428
msgid "Minor Python completer token counting bug fix."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5429
msgid "multiline syntax error in PTK shell due to buffer not being reset"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5430
msgid ""
"Segfaults and other early exit signals are now reported correctly, again."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5432
msgid "`tests/bin/{cat,pwd,wc}` shebang changed to python3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5434
msgid "v0.5.1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5438
msgid "Fixed xonfig raising error when xonsh is not installed from source."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5440
msgid "v0.5.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5444
msgid ""
"\\$XONTRIB_MPL_MINIMAL environment variable can be set to change if plots "
"are minimalist or as-seen"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5446
msgid ""
"xontrib-mpl now supports iTerm2 inline image display if iterm2_tools python "
"package is installed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5448
msgid ""
"Xonsh now will fallback to other shells if encountered errors when starting "
"up."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5450
msgid "Added entry to customization faq re: `dirs` alias (#1452)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5451
msgid "Added entry to customization faq re: tab completion selection (#1725)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5453
msgid "Added entry to customization faq re: libgcc core dump (#1160)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5454
msgid "Section about quoting in the tutorial."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5455
msgid ""
"The `$VC_HG_SHOW_BRANCH` environment variable to control whether to hide the "
"hg branch in the prompt."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5457
msgid ""
"xonfig now contains the latest git commit date if xonsh installed from "
"source."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5459
msgid ""
"Alt+Enter will execute a multiline code block irrespective of cursor position"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5461
msgid ""
"Windows now has the ability to read output asynchronously from the console."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5463
msgid ""
"Use [doctr](https://drdoctr.github.io/doctr/) to deploy dev docs to github "
"pages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5465
msgid ""
"New `xonsh.proc.uncapturable()` decorator for declaring that function "
"aliases should not be run in a captured subprocess."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5467
msgid "New history backend sqlite."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5468
msgid ""
"Prompt user to install xontrib package if they try to load an uninstalled "
"xontrib"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5470
msgid ""
"Callable aliases may now take a final `spec` argument, which is the "
"corresponding `SubprocSpec` instance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5472
msgid ""
"New `bashisms` xontrib provides additional Bash-like syntax, such as `!!`. "
"This xontrib only affects the command line, and not xonsh scripts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5475
msgid "Tests that create testing repos (git, hg)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5476
msgid ""
"New subprocess specification class `SubprocSpec` is used for specifying and "
"manipulating subprocess classes prior to execution."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5478
msgid "New `PopenThread` class runs subprocesses on a a separate thread."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5479
msgid ""
"New `CommandPipeline` and `HiddenCommandPipeline` classes manage the "
"execution of a pipeline of commands via the execution of the last command in "
"the pipeline. Instances may be iterated and stream lines from the stdout "
"buffer. These pipelines read from the stdout & stderr streams in a non-"
"blocking manner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5484
msgid "`$XONSH_STORE_STDOUT` is now available on all platforms!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5485
msgid ""
"The `CommandsCache` now has the ability to predict whether or not a command "
"must be run in the foreground using `Popen` or may use a background thread "
"and can use `PopenThread`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5488
msgid ""
"Callable aliases may now use the full gamut of functions signatures: `f()`, "
"`f(args)`, `f(args, stdin=None)`, `f(args, stdin=None, stdout=None)`, and [ ]"
"{.title-ref}[f(args, stdin=None, stdout=None, stderr=None)]{.title-ref}\\`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5492
msgid ""
"Uncaptured subprocesses now receive a PTY file handle for stdout and stderr."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5494
msgid ""
"New `$XONSH_PROC_FREQUENCY` environment variable that specifies how long "
"loops in the subprocess framework should sleep. This may be adjusted from "
"its default value to improved performance and mitigate \\\"leaky\\\" pipes "
"on slower machines."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5498
msgid "`Shift+Tab` moves backwards in completion dropdown in prompt_toolkit"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5499
msgid "PromptFormatter class that holds all the related prompt methods"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5500
msgid "PromptFormatter caching when building the prompt"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5501
msgid "p-strings: `p'/foo/bar'` is short for `pathlib.Path('/foo/bar')`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5502
msgid "byte strings: prefixes other than `b'foo'` (eg, `RB'foo'`) now work"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5503
msgid ""
"Backticks for regex or glob searches now support an additional modifier `p`, "
"which causes them to return Path objects instead of strings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5506
msgid ""
"New `BOTTOM_TOOLBAR` environment variable to control a bottom toolbar as "
"specified in prompt-toolkit"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5508
msgid ""
"New `$XONSH_STDERR_PREFIX` and `$XONSH_STDERR_POSTFIX` environment variables "
"allow the user to print a prompt-like string before and after all stderr "
"that is seen. For example, say that you would like stderr to appear on a red "
"background, you might set `$XONSH_STDERR_PREFIX = \"{BACKGROUND_RED}\"` and "
"`$XONSH_STDERR_PREFIX = \"{NO_COLOR}\"`."
msgstr ""

