"longer runs the user\\'s rc file, unless the `--login` option is specified. "
"Also avoids loading aliases and environments from foreign shells, as well as "
"loading bash completions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:6641
msgid ""
"rc files are now compiled and cached, to avoid re-parsing when they "
"haven\\'t changed. Scripts are also compiled and cached, and there is the "
"option to cache interactive commands."
