"references to it. This may cause a problem if you were using a raw color "
"code in your xonshrc file from `$FORMATTER_DICT`. To fix, simply remove "
"these references."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:6746
msgid "Multidimensional slicing, as in numpy, no longer throws SyntaxErrors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:6748
msgid "Some minor zsh fixes for more platforms and setups."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:6749
msgid ""
"The `BaseShell.settitle` method no longer has its commands captured by "
"`$(...)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:6752
msgid "v0.2.6"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:6756
msgid ""
"`trace` alias added that enables users to turn on and off the printing of "
"source code lines prior to their execution. This is useful for debugging "
"scripts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:6759
msgid ""
"New ability to force callable alias functions to be run in the foreground, i."
"e. the main thread from which the function was called. This is useful for "
"debuggers and profilers which may require such access. Use the `xonsh.proc."
"foreground` decorator on an alias function to flag it. `ForegroundProcProxy` "
"and `SimpleForegroundProcProxy` classes have been added to support this "
"feature. Normally, forcing a foreground alias is not needed."
msgstr ""

